# `wiki/` is generated by ./seed.mjs, not committed. See README.md → "Why the
# wiki is generated rather than committed".
#
# The short version: `llmwiki template init` refuses to install a profile over a
# non-empty typed corpus — a profile is installed into an empty project and the
# project is populated afterwards, because reinterpreting existing pages under a
# new schema is a migration, not an install. So the committed copy of this
# example's pages lives in `content/`, and `seed.mjs` materializes it into the
# profile-declared directories after the install.
#
# `wiki/graph/` (the relation + event stores) and the two article pages the
# seeded workflow runs write live are generated for their own reasons, and are
# covered by the same rule.
wiki/
